<title>GERMANY: German Hoechst falls after UK presentation.</title>
<headline>German Hoechst falls after UK presentation.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in German chemical group Hoechst AG fell 1.45 marks to 64.35 marks on Thursday as dealers said that a presentation by the company to British institutional investors had been poorly received. The dealers could give no further details of why the presentation had been disappointing.</p>
<p>The wider IBIS-DAX electronic trade index was meanwhile nearly half a percent higher in late dealings.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
